{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["And the man shall be clear from iniquity — even though he brought this punishment upon her by means of the jealousy-warning (קנוי) with which he warned her. And it seems to me: and the man shall be clear from iniquity — that he did not tolerate his wife being unfaithful under him; had he remained silent, he would not be clear from iniquity, since she would be forbidden to him; rather, she shall bear her iniquity, for she committed adultery, and therefore she received her punishment."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:34.792627120Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}